sentences.t:
Petit ante alios pulcherrimus omnis
Turnus, avis atavisque potens, quem regia coniunx
adiungi generum miro properabat amore;

sentences.l:
Seeks before others, most handsome of all,
Turnus, by grandfathers and forefathers powerful, whom the royal wife
to be joined as son-in-law was hastening with wondrous love;
